WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.500
[Soft instrumental music]
A closer look at life. Explore biological structures and processes.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.100
From the cell to its inner world. A representative plant cell.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.700
Bacterium. An educational model of a Gram-negative rod.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.300
Fungi. Explore a representative yeast cell.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.900
Paramecium. One cell, many specialized functions.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:21.500
Beyond cells. The architecture of a T2 bacteriophage.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:27.100
Rotate. Look inside. Take it apart. Explore mitochondrial structure.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:33.700
Make biological processes visible. Transcription: the making of RNA.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:39.300
From light energy to the chemistry of life. Photosynthesis.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:44.900
From genetic information to protein. Ribosomal translation.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:49.900
The details of life are worth a closer look. BioScape, created by Kun Qian.
